n=B.bc.a_C(A.av(["contents",A.b([A.av(["parts",A.b([A.av(["text",'Bu g\xf6rselde bir say\u0131m ka\u011f\u0131d\u0131 var. 3 s\xfctun halinde kutucuklar var.\nHer kutucukta:\n- Barkod ve alt\u0131nda bas\u0131lm\u0131\u015f kodu/yaz\u0131s\u0131\n- "Adet:" etiketi ve yan\u0131nda/alt\u0131nda el yaz\u0131s\u0131 say\u0131lar (\xf6rn: 34, 24, 15, 42, 53, 40, 9 SON vs.)\n\nG\xd6REV:\n1. Yaln\u0131zca el yaz\u0131s\u0131 ile adet girilmi\u015f olan h\xfccreleri s\u0131ras\u0131yla listele. Bo\u015f h\xfccreleri ALMA.\n2. "quantity" (adet) k\u0131sm\u0131nda YALNIZCA RAKAM / SAYI olmal\u0131d\u0131r! "SON", "Adet" gibi hi\xe7bir harf veya kelimeyi YAZMA (\xf6rn: "9 SON" yaz\u0131yorsa YALNIZCA "9" yaz).\n3. BARKODUN ALTINDAK\u0130 YAZIYI OKUMA (\xc7OK \xd6NEML\u0130):\n   - Barkodun hemen alt\u0131nda bas\u0131l\u0131 metin/kod ne yaz\u0131yorsa do\u011frudan ve aynen onu oku.\n   - Baz\u0131 ka\u011f\u0131tlarda tarih yerine farkl\u0131 ibareler, harfler veya say\u0131lar yazabilir; kesinlikle belirli bir tarih format\u0131 veya kal\u0131p (RR-XXXX/YYYY gibi) dayatma.\n   - Araya veya ba\u015f\u0131na tire (\'-\'), e\u011fik \xe7izgi (\'/\') gibi i\u015faretler KOYMA / EKLEME. Tire falan koymadan do\u011frudan barkodun alt\u0131nda ne yaz\u0131yorsa onu d\xfcz bir \u015fekilde yaz.\n4. \xdcST\xdc \xc7\u0130Z\u0130L\u0130 / KARALANMI\u015e ADETLER (\xc7OK \xd6NEML\u0130):\n   - Bazen el yaz\u0131s\u0131 adetlerin \xfczeri \xe7izilmi\u015f, karalanm\u0131\u015f veya iptal edilmi\u015f olabilir.\n   - \xdcst\xfc \xe7izili veya karalanm\u0131\u015f say\u0131lar\u0131 kesin do\u011fru bir adetmi\u015f gibi okumaya veya tahmin etmeye \xc7ALI\u015eMA!\n   - E\u011fer say\u0131n\u0131n \xfcst\xfc \xe7izilip yan\u0131na/\xfcst\xfcne YEN\u0130 ve net bir say\u0131 yaz\u0131lm\u0131\u015fsa, yaln\u0131zca o yeni say\u0131y\u0131 adet olarak al.\n   - E\u011fer kutucuktaki say\u0131n\u0131n \xfczeri \xe7izilmi\u015f/karalanm\u0131\u015fsa ve yan\u0131nda yeni bir say\u0131 yoksa (veya karalama nedeniyle ne yazd\u0131\u011f\u0131 teredd\xfctl\xfcyse):\n     * Say\u0131y\u0131 kesin gibi kabul edip okumaya zorlama.\n     * Bu h\xfccre i\xe7in "confidence" (eminlik skoru) de\u011ferini MUTLAKA %87\'nin alt\u0131nda (60 - 75 aras\u0131nda) D\xdc\u015e\xdcK ver ki sistem bu sat\u0131rda kullan\u0131c\u0131ya do\u011frudan k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 uyar\u0131 g\xf6stersin!\n5. "confidence": Okuma do\u011frulu\u011fu ve el yaz\u0131s\u0131 netli\u011fi i\xe7in 0-100 aras\u0131nda bir eminlik skoru belirle (say\u0131 olarak):\n   - El yaz\u0131s\u0131 ve barkod net ve teredd\xfcts\xfcz ise: 92 - 100\n   - El yaz\u0131s\u0131 biraz silik, teredd\xfctl\xfc veya rakamlar tam net de\u011filse (%92 alt\u0131 sar\u0131 uyar\u0131): 87 - 91\n   - \xdcst\xfc \xe7izili, karalanm\u0131\u015f, \xfczeri karalamayla kapat\u0131lm\u0131\u015f, \xe7ok silik veya 1/7, 0/6, 3/8 gibi teredd\xfct i\xe7eren t\xfcm \u015f\xfcpheli okumalarda (%87 alt\u0131 KIRMIZI UYARI): 60 - 75 (Kesinlikle 87\'nin alt\u0131nda olmal\u0131!)\n6. SAYFA BA\u015eLIK B\u0130LG\u0130LER\u0130 (\xc7OK \xd6NEML\u0130 - DOSYA ADI \u0130\xc7\u0130N):\n   Ka\u011f\u0131d\u0131n en \xfcst k\u0131sm\u0131nda yer alan ba\u015fl\u0131k bilgilerini dikkatle oku:\n   - "area" (Sa\u011f \xdcstteki Alan Ad\u0131):\n     * Ka\u011f\u0131d\u0131n sa\u011f \xfcst k\u0131sm\u0131nda genellikle alan ad\u0131 k\u0131sm\u0131 olur (\xf6rn: "reyon", "tester", "depo", "stand", "\xe7ekmece" vb. yaz\u0131lar).\n     * Sa\u011f \xfcstte yazan bu alan/b\xf6l\xfcm ad\u0131n\u0131 do\u011frudan oku (k\xfc\xe7\xfck harflerle, \xf6rn: "reyon"). E\u011fer sa\u011f \xfcstte b\xf6yle bir alan yaz\u0131s\u0131 yoksa veya okunmuyorsa bo\u015f ("") b\u0131rak.\n   - "venue" (Sol \xdcstteki Mekan / Marka):\n     * Ka\u011f\u0131d\u0131n sol \xfcst k\u0131sm\u0131nda genellikle tarih ve ard\u0131ndan tire i\u015faretleri ile ayr\u0131lm\u0131\u015f bilgiler yer al\u0131r (\xf6rn: "26.12.2026 - FLORMAR - ..." veya "26/12/2026 - FLORMAR - 01").\n     * Tarihten sonra gelen ilk iki tire aras\u0131ndaki kelime mekan/marka ad\u0131d\u0131r (\xf6rn: "flormar").\n     * Bu kelimeyi oku (k\xfc\xe7\xfck harflerle, \xf6rn: "flormar"). E\u011fer sol \xfcstte bu formatta veya mekan ad\u0131 yoksa bo\u015f ("") b\u0131rak.\n   - "date" (Sol \xdcstteki Tarih):\n     * Sol \xfcstte yer alan tarihi \'GG_AA_YYYY\' format\u0131nda oku (\xf6rn: "26_12_2026"). E\u011fer tarih yoksa bo\u015f ("") b\u0131rak.\n   - "raw_top_left": Sol \xfcstte yazan t\xfcm metni oldu\u011fu gibi aynen aktar (\xf6rn: "26.12.2026 - FLORMAR - KADIK\xd6Y").\n   - "raw_top_right": Sa\u011f \xfcstte yazan t\xfcm metni oldu\u011fu gibi aynen aktar (\xf6rn: "REYON").\n\nYALNIZCA ge\xe7erli bir JSON format\u0131nda d\xf6nd\xfcr:\n{\n  "header": {\n    "area": "reyon",\n    "venue": "flormar",\n    "date": "26_12_2026",\n    "raw_top_left": "26.12.2026 - FLORMAR - KADIK\xd6Y",\n    "raw_top_right": "REYON"\n  },\n  "entries": [\n    {"barcode": "RR01332710", "quantity": "34", "confidence": 98}\n  ]\n}\n'],a3,a3),A.av(["inline_data",A.av(["mime_type","image/jpeg","data",a4],a3,a3)],a3,t.GU)],t.Mq)],a3,t.JD)],t.lU),"generationConfig",A.av(["temperature",0.1,"response_mime_type","application/json"],a3,a5)],a3,a5),null)
